WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.600 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Let's check out the ruins over there.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.500 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Watch for danger, and warn me if anything looks wrong.

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.200 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: I'll keep watch. If there's danger, staying alive comes first.

4
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.400 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: There's a mob ahead. Don't get too close.

5
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.700 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: It's just one. Let's try.

6
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.500 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: You open the gate and fight it. If we can't win, get us out.

7
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.300 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: On it.

8
00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.300 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Run! Back inside the gate!

9
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:48.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: No good, I'm losing health too fast!

10
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.500 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Get me back to camp. Don't trade hits with it!

11
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.900 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: We're back inside the gate. Recover first.

12
00:00:55.900 --> 00:01:00.600 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Why didn't we keep fighting? Not enough health, or bad gear?

13
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.600 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: We were bare-handed, so our damage was low and we lost health fast. That's why we pulled back.

14
00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:10.300 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Health is 14 now. Resupply first, then fight.

15
00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:15.900 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Eat some bread to heal first. We'll go back once we've recovered.

16
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Eating first, then healing. No rush to go back.

17
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.500 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: I'll walk this part. Keep watching for me.

18
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.100 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: OK, you go. I'm keeping track of the goal and the materials.

19
00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:49.200 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: We have cobblestone and iron ingots.

20
00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:52.500 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Stone sword or iron sword? You choose this time.

21
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.700 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: The iron sword. It does more damage, but it uses up both iron ingots.

22
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.200 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: OK. Make the one you said.

23
00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:13.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: OK, doing that.

24
00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.900 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Do we have enough food? Don't burn our way out just for revenge.

25
00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:24.600 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Health 20, hunger 20, and one bread left.

26
00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:29.800 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: I want to go back for revenge now. Are we ready?

27
00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:38.100 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Health is back and the iron sword is ready. Let's see where it is before we head out.

28
00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:54.600 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Ready. Let's find that one. You open the gate and take over the fight.

29
00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:01.100 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: On it. Watching our health.

30
00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:03.500 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Keep fighting. I'll watch the health for you.

31
00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:09.400 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Staying on this one, and keeping our way out open.

32
00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.200 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: It's down. The same one as before!

33
00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:18.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: We couldn't beat it earlier. Why did we win this time?

34
00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:24.600 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: This time we'd eaten, our health was full, and we had the iron sword.

35
00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.500 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: It hits much harder than bare hands, so we took it down.

36
00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:33.200 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: What did it drop? How much health and food do we have left?

37
00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:40.700 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Health 13, hunger 17, and one bread left.

38
00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Good, revenge taken.

39
00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:48.100 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Next time, let's prepare first. I'll take it from here.

40
00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:54.500 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: OK, you go. I'm keeping track of the goal and the materials.
